      "quote": "• CuriousLLM Agent: We design an LLM\nagent to ask follow-up questions, thus improv-\ning the efficiency and precision of the KGP\nframework without requiring extensive fine-\ntuning.\n• Experimental Validation: We present com-\nprehensive experimental results that demon-\nstrate significant improvements in both the\nperformance and efficiency of the KGP frame-\nwork using our approach. Furthermore, an\nablation study highlights the enhanced reason-\ning capabilities of our LLM agent, particularly\nafter fine-tuning on the Follow-upQA dataset.\n2\n",
